{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A regular hexagon with sides of length 6 has an isosceles triangle attached to each side. Each of these triangles has two sides of length 8. The isosceles triangles are folded to make a pyramid with the hexagon as the base of the pyramid. What is the volume of the pyramid?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a8251526f4c14f777cf04938bcb76a291b016ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; 18 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; 162 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; 36\\sqrt{21} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; 18\\sqrt{138} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; 54\\sqrt{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"512\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The distance from a corner to the center is 6, and from the corner to the top of the pyramid is 8, so the height is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/9/4494e52749dbc98fbe531bf19a9949ff389d579d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{8^2 - 6^2} = \\sqrt{64 - 36} = \\sqrt{28} = 2\\sqrt{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"284\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>The area of the hexagon is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb97fa93c4994fd942b2dae2168bdbdb81ec6e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cdot (\\text{side})^2 = \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cdot 6^2 = 54\\sqrt{3}\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the volume of the pyramid is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7f855aa1137990641e2f567f2b1b3613ed760fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3} \\times \\text{base} \\times \\text{height} = \\frac{ 54\\sqrt{3} \\cdot 2\\sqrt{7}}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\; 36\\sqrt{21}}\\]\" width=\"370\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title